  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Carbonnade is Belgium's great beef stew. You "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "braise",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "braise"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " thick slices of shin in dark beer with slow-cooked onions, and the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "fond",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "fond"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " from browning the meat gives the sauce its depth. Mustard stirred in at the end sharpens everything."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cook the onions low and slow until deep golden and sweet before adding the meat. This takes 20 minutes, not 5."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
